@node Lua Frontend
@chapter Lua Frontend Language

Lua is a lightweight, dynamically-typed scripting language widely used for
game scripting and embedded systems programming. The EIGHTBOL Lua frontend
compiles Lua source to EIGHTBOL's canonical AST, enabling Lua programs to
target 8-bit and 16-bit retro platforms. This chapter documents the complete
Lua language as supported by EIGHTBOL, with comprehensive syntax, semantics,
and AST mappings.

